{"nodes":[{"connection":"The Simpsons","article_title":"The Best Stephen Hawking Jokes on The Simpsons","description":"\"Stephen Hawking is equally well-known for two things: his revolutionary work in physics, and his guest appearances on The Simpsons. The British scientist has played himself on the series at least four times, first in the Season 10 episode \"They Saved Lisa's Brain,\" in which Lisa joins the local Springfield chapter of Mensa. Like The Simpsons in general over the last 15 years, his cameos can be hit-or-miss, but when he's on, he can be one of the funniest guest stars the show has ever had. Here are some of his best jokes on the show.\"        ","author":"Henry Stewart","date":"1/8/2014","source":"The L Magazine","url":"http://www.thelmagazine.com/TheMeasure/archives/2014/01/08/the-best-stephen-hawking-jokes-on-the-simpsons","slug":"simpsons","strong_parents":"tv","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Big Bang Theory","article_title":"Stephen Hawking Corrects Sheldon's Math On 'The Big Bang Theory'","description":"\"Stephen Hawking has done several guest appearances on television shows over the years, but perhaps none of them felt quite as right as when he appeared as himself on \"The Big Bang Theory\" (Thu., 8 p.m. ET on CBS). After all, there is no bigger fan of the brilliant physicist than Sheldon Cooper, who considers himself Hawking's only equal.\"        \n","author":" ","date":"4/6/2012","source":"Huffington Post","url":"http://www.huffingtonpost.com/2012/04/06/stephen-hawking-corrects-sheldon-big-bang-theory-video_n_1407616.html","slug":"big_bang","strong_parents":"tv","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Futurama","article_title":"Stephen Hawking","description":"\"Stephen Hawking is a world-renowned genius and physicist. In Futurama, he depicts a snarky version of himself who preys on Fry’s stupidity. In a non-canon episode, he is a member of Al Gore’s Vice Presidential Action Rangers with Nichelle Nichols and Gary Gygax. As a head in a jar, he has the ability to shoot lasers from his eyes as a way to fend off evil, though he is unaware until it happens, as he proclaims, “I didn’t know I could do that.” He provides his own voice for his character.\"","author":" ","date":"","source":"IGN","url":"http://www.ign.com/wikis/futurama/Stephen_Hawking","slug":"futurama","strong_parents":"tv","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Late Night with Conan O'Brien","article_title":"Hawking: the man behind the physics","description":"\"Hawking has agreed to appear in a number of comedy shows, including The Simpsons. He also featured in a sketch with Carrey on Late Night With Conan O'Brien and they later forged a friendship.\n\"You don't expect Jim Carrey to pop up in a film about Stephen Hawking, but so much is written about his science […] Jim represents a lot of Stephen's humour,\" explains Finnigan.\"","author":"Olivia Solon","date":"","source":"Wired","url":"http://www.wired.co.uk/news/archive/2013-09/17/hawking/viewgallery/ytvJVXusKP93w","slug":"conan","strong_parents":"tv","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"The Onion","article_title":"Stephen Hawking Builds Robotic Exoskeleton","description":"Nobel Prize-winning physicist Stephen Hawking stunned the international scientific community Monday with his latest breakthrough, a remarkably advanced cybernetic exoskeleton designed to replace his wheelchair.","author":" ","date":"","source":"The Onion","url":"http://www.theonion.com/articles/stephen-hawking-builds-robotic-exoskeleton,1629/","slug":"onion","strong_parents":"news","weak_parents":"satire","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Avengers","article_title":"‘The Avengers’: A Pop-Culture Cheat Sheet","description":"For as many epic fight scenes as “The Avengers” has, it has even more pop-culture Easter eggs sprinkled throughout. Thanks in large part to the combined efforts of writer/director Joss Whedon and snark master Robert Downey Jr., “The Avengers” is chock-full of witty pop-culture references worth dissecting and analyzing. So we did our best to catalog each and every nod, wink and jab featured in Marvel’s ultimate crossover movie. The world-renowned theoretical physicist, whose “A Brief History of Time” sold more than 10 million copies, is mentioned during a conversation among the Avengers.","author":"Kevin P. Sullivan","date":"5/7/2012","source":"MTV News","url":"http://www.mtv.com/news/1684593/avengers-movie-pop-culture/","slug":"avengers","strong_parents":"movies","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Doctor Who","article_title":"Doctor Who's target audience is Stephen Hawking","description":"As the series reaches a mind-bendingly complex conclusion far beyond the comprehension of normal minds, Moffat revealed he just wants to entertain Stephen Hawking.\n\nStephen Moffat said: “You can pander to kids, or you can go for the more select demographic of the world’s top physicist.\n\n“There was literally nothing on telly these days to complicated enough to challenge Stephen Hawking, so we made it our goal to ‘make Steve’s brain hurt’.","author":" ","date":"5/17/2013","source":"The Daily Mash","url":"http://www.thedailymash.co.uk/news/arts-entertainment/doctor-whos-target-audience-is-stephen-hawking-2013051769169","slug":"doctor_who","strong_parents":"tv","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Pink Floyd","article_title":"Stephen Hawking Has A Guest Vocal On Pink Floyd's New Album","description":"Stephen Hawking will bring his iconic synthesized voice to Pink Floyd's new album, The Endless River, set for release in November. It's the famed physicist's second collaboration with the British band, having appeared on the 1994 track \"Keep Talkin' \" from The Division Bell.","author":"Scott Neuman","date":"","source":"NPR","url":"http://www.npr.org/blogs/thetwo-way/2014/10/09/354861288/stephen-hawking-in-guest-vocal-on-pink-floyds-new-album","slug":"pink_floyd","strong_parents":"music","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Star Trek - The Next Generation","article_title":"Hawking, Dr. Stephen","description":"Dr. Stephen Hawking was one of three great minds of Earth science —along with Albert Einstein and Sir Isaac Newton—that Data used to create holographic recreations with whiich to play poker and converse, for recreation. ","author":" ","date":"","source":"Star Trek","url":"http://www.startrek.com/database_article/hawking","slug":"star_trek","strong_parents":"movies","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"pop_culture","exclude":""},{"connection":"Stephen Hawking","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"stephen_hawking","strong_parents":"","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"Pop Culture","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"pop_culture","strong_parents":"stephen_hawking","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"TV","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"tv","strong_parents":"pop_culture","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"News","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"news","strong_parents":"stephen_hawking","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"Movies","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"movies","strong_parents":"pop_culture","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"Satire","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"satire","strong_parents":"","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""},{"connection":"Music","article_title":"","description":"","author":"","date":"","source":"","url":"","slug":"music","strong_parents":"pop_culture","weak_parents":"","primary_category":"","exclude":""}],"links":[{"source":0,"target":11},{"source":1,"target":11},{"source":2,"target":11},{"source":3,"target":11},{"source":4,"target":12},{"source":5,"target":13},{"source":6,"target":11},{"source":7,"target":15},{"source":8,"target":13},{"source":10,"target":9},{"source":11,"target":10},{"source":12,"target":9},{"source":13,"target":10},{"source":15,"target":10}]}